@startuml serial_open 线路控制与引导切换
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title serial_open 线路控制与 IAP→应用引导切换

participant "AI\n调用方" as AI
participant "MCP\nserial_open" as M
participant "传输层\nSerialShell" as T
participant "CH340\n(DTR/RTS)" as C
participant "固件\nIAP / APP" as F

== open 阶段（线路防护 + 一键就绪）==

AI -> M : serial_open(stm32)
M -> T : new SerialShell(config).open()
T -> C : open(COM4)
note over C : 驱动瞬间断言 DTR/RTS\n一键下载电路竞态窗口\n(BOOT0/nRST 可能被拉动)
T -> C : set({ dtr: off, rts: off }) 显式线序防护
T -> C : set({ dtr: off, rts: on })\n按住 RESET 200ms (resetOnOpen)
T -> C : set({ rts: off }) 释放
note over C, F : 复位释放沿 BOOT0=0\n芯片从主 Flash 干净启动
C -> F : 复位 → IAP 引导启动
F --> T : IAP banner (NOINIT/PARAM/UPD...)
T --> M : banner
M --> AI : Session serial_N + [MCU 模式已启用,\nDTR/RTS 线序: off/off, resetOnOpen 已执行]

== 引导切换（发应用命令的前置）==

AI -> M : serial_mcu_exec("go flash")
M -> F : "go flash\\r\\n"
F -> F : IAP 慢初始化(SRAM 测试/lwIP)\n→ 跳转 0x08020000
F --> M : IAP: jump to APP / APP: ready
M --> AI : 输出 + [MCU: 静默 400ms 判定完成]

note over AI, F
  此后应用命令(wifi info / at / sram)直接发
  启动竞态提醒: 应用刚启动时发命令会吃字节
  (实测 wifi info → echo "fi info")
  应先 serial_read(waitMs) 等到 APP: ready
end note

@enduml
